 "drawing": "Two-door cabinet = lower cupboard (tумба) + upper glass showcase, 2 sections split by a partition. No dimension lines on any drawing. Lower: sides 3,4 and partition 5 (681 high) stand on bottom 2 (920x446, Direkta 7x70), bars 15 (420x70, 2) set between them with dowels; top 1 (920x446) is screwed onto sides+partition (eccentrics). Top/bottom 920 overhang the carcass: 3x16+2x420 = 888 carcass, so ~16 mm each side (assuming 16 mm board). Plinth box 12/14 (908x70) + 13 (368x70, 2) with 4 levelling feet under the bottom, joined by 4 corner brackets. Lower facade per section: drawer front 7/8 (199 high x 425 wide) on top, door 16 (476 high x 425 wide) below (199+476=675 vs 681 side). Drawers: sides 400x150, back 362x150, bottom ДВП 405x392, 400 mm ball guides (2). One removable ЛДСП shelf 6 (418x416) per lower section. Upper showcase: sides 20,21 and partition 22 (1338x426) stand on top 1; top 26 (920x446) on them; cornice 25а front 1002x86 + 25б sides 491x86 (2) screwed on top 26. Glass doors 27 (425 wide x 1334 high, 2); 4 glass shelves 24 (418x416, 2 per section) on 16 glass-shelf supports; LED: 4 clips + transformer. Pilasters 17 (681x22) and 23 (1338x22) glued on the front edges of the sides. Backs ДВП: lower 19 441x714 x2 side by side (441x2=882 vs 888 carcass; 714 = 681+2x16+1), upper 28 441x1373 x2 (1373 = 1338+2x16+3). Hinges K-16 inset 10 = 3 per glass door + 2 per lower door; handles 6 (2 drawers + 2 doors + 2 glass doors). Overall height estimate (16 mm boards): 70+16+681+16+1338+16 = 2137 + cornice. front view: pages/turin-0-10-p1.png 398,495,487,690"
